<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { meta: { title: 'Privacy Policy | GetQuotationMaker', desc: 'What GetQuotationMaker does with your data: quote details sent to build your PDF, what stays in your browser, Gumroad licence checks and who else receives data.', path: '/privacy' } }) %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<header class="hero">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lead">GetQuotationMaker has no accounts, no analytics and no advertising. This page lists the data the site handles, where it goes and why.</p>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: 11 October 2026</p>
</header>

<main class="article">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
    <p>GetQuotationMaker (www.getquotationmaker.com) is run by Peak Apps Studio. For any question about your data, email <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>When you make a quote</h2>
    <p>The form and the live preview run in your browser. When you press a download button, your browser sends the quote to our server, which builds the PDF. The request contains what you typed: your business name, email address and postal address, your client's name, email address and postal address, the quote number and dates, the line items, prices, tax and discount, your notes and terms, and your logo if you added one.</p>
    <p>The server builds the PDF in memory, sends it back to your browser and does not keep a copy of the quote. If a PDF fails to build, the server writes a technical error message to our hosting logs.</p>

    <h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your own details.</strong> Your business name, email address and postal address are saved in your browser's local storage, so they are filled in next time. They stay on your device until you clear this site's data in your browser settings.</li>
      <li><strong>The Pro cookie.</strong> If you activate Pro, your licence key is saved in a cookie called <code>qm_license</code> so that Pro stays on in that browser. The cookie lasts one year and is sent only to this site. The "Remove Pro from this browser" button on the Activate Pro page deletes it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The site sets no other cookies and uses none for tracking or advertising.</p>

    <h2>Licence checks</h2>
    <p>When you enter a licence key on the Activate Pro page, our server sends it to Gumroad's licence service (api.gumroad.com) to confirm that it belongs to a valid purchase that has not been refunded. On later visits the server checks the key again and keeps the answer in its memory for up to six hours. Gumroad's answer includes details of the purchase; we use it only to decide whether Pro is on, and we do not store it.</p>

    <h2>Buying Pro</h2>
    <p>Pro is sold through Gumroad. The Get Pro buttons open Gumroad's checkout, where you give your payment details to Gumroad, not to us. As the seller, we receive your email address and the details of your order from Gumroad, and we use them to answer questions about your purchase and to issue refunds.</p>

    <h2>Fonts</h2>
    <p>The site's fonts load from Google Fonts. To fetch them, your browser connects to Google's servers, which receive your IP address and browser details.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site runs on Vercel. Like any web host, Vercel processes each request, including your IP address, the page you asked for and your browser type, and keeps request logs for a limited time.</p>

    <h2>Emails</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we receive your email address and your message. Mail sent to peakappsstudio.com addresses is forwarded by Forward Email to a Gmail inbox. We use your email only to reply to you.</p>

    <h2>Who else receives data</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>What for</th><th>Privacy policy</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Vercel</td><td>Hosting the site and its server</td><td><a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-notice" rel="noopener">vercel.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Gumroad</td><td>Checkout, payments and licence checks</td><td><a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy" rel="noopener">gumroad.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Google</td><td>Web fonts, and the Gmail inbox for our email</td><td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">policies.google.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Forward Email</td><td>Forwarding mail sent to our address</td><td><a href="https://forwardemail.net/en/privacy" rel="noopener">forwardemail.net</a></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>Vercel, Gumroad and Google are based in the United States, so your data may be processed there. We do not sell your data, and we do not share it with advertisers.</p>

    <h2>How long data is kept</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Quote details: only while the server builds your PDF.</li>
      <li>Details saved in your browser: until you clear them. The Pro cookie expires after one year.</li>
      <li>Licence check results: up to six hours in the server's memory.</li>
      <li>Hosting logs: kept by Vercel for a limited time under its own policy.</li>
      <li>Purchase records: kept by Gumroad under its own policy.</li>
      <li>Emails: until we delete them. Ask us and we will delete yours, unless we need it as a record of a payment or refund.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us for a copy of the personal data we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to how we use it. Email <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a> and we will reply within one month. Most of the data this site uses never reaches us: you can delete what is saved in your browser yourself by clearing this site's data. If you live in the EU or the UK, you can also complain to your local data protection authority.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>GetQuotationMaker is a tool for businesses and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If the site starts handling data differently, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Peak Apps Studio, <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a>. See also our <a href="/terms">terms of use</a>.</p>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
